      },
      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ap60n",
            "text": "朋友们大家好啊，我是金尘马。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "avdmt",
            "text": "有些朋友已经在用 Codex、Claude Code 这类 Agent，也想做 AI 知识库，却卡在了资料到底存哪里。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ahkrl",
            "text": "Obsidian 是一个非常受欢迎的本地知识管理软件。它基于本地文件，开放、可迁移，也很适合 Agent 操作。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aqokd",
            "text": "但对部分刚开始接触知识库的用户来说，目录、Markdown 和多设备同步都需要学习成本。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "dparr",
            "text": "如果平时已经在飞书里写文档，又希望手机、电脑随时访问，那么飞书文档 + 官方 Lark CLI，也可以成为一条云端知识库路线。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 42,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "fjffh",
            "text": "这篇文章只解决一件事：怎样把飞书变成 Agent 可以读取、整理和回写的云端知识库。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fkqh4",
            "text": "一、飞书文档知识库构成",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5rk9j",
            "text": "云笔记主要解决保存、同步和搜索。AI 知识库还要能找到相关资料，理清它们的关系，并把整理结果写回文档。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "buu77",
            "text": "一套能工作的 AI 知识库，至少有四个部分。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7mla0",
            "text": "飞书知识库负责页面树和知识空间。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2vig5",
            "text": "飞书文档负责保存具体内容。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ft0ib",
            "text": "Lark CLI 负责把文档能力交给 Agent。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cegvc",
            "text": "Agent 加工作规则负责整理和维护。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 51,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "7cq59",
            "text": "可以把飞书理解成云端资料室，CLI 是 AI 操控云端资料室的工具，Agent 是进资料室干活的助手。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9bnm7",
            "text": "资料室搭好以后，还得给助手明确权限和规则。否则，要么资料没人整理，要么 Agent 容易改错文件。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7rhpp",
            "text": "二、这条路线适合谁",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7mkh",
            "text": "这套方案更适合云端优先、经常跨设备使用、已经习惯飞书，并且手里有 Agent 工具的人。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b7jjk",
            "text": "如果更看重本地开放文件、离线使用、Git 版本管理和完整迁移能力，Obsidian 或其他 Markdown 方案依然更合适。大家根据自己的情况，选择合适的方案即可。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a94qi",
            "text": "开始前需要准备：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cbfop",
            "text": "一个可以执行终端命令的 Agent。例如：WorkBuddy、Codex、Claude Code等。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2demi",
            "text": "一个飞书账号。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "15sl3",
            "text": "一台能够运行 Node.js 与 npx 的电脑，基本上是个 windows 和 Mac 电脑都支持。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4h6on",
            "text": "创建飞书应用并完成用户授权的条件。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "50ajb",
            "text": "第一次测试只使用无敏感信息的文档。不要直接把工作机密、客户资料或唯一原件交给 Agent。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "amees",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2eht8",
            "text": "三、先讲清 Lark CLI 能做什么",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 8,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3dvh4",
            "text": "Lark CLI 是飞书官方提供的命令行工具，也为 AI Agent 准备了对应的 Skills。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4429r",
            "text": "搭这套最小知识库，只会用到三组能力。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "sd22",
            "text": "Docs 负责创建、读取和更新文档。Wiki 负责知识空间与页面节点。Drive 负责搜索文档和 Wiki。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cvqmd",
            "text": "这三组能力刚好对应知识库最常见的动作：找到资料、读取内容、创建页面、调整结构，再把整理结果写回飞书。不用背下所有命令，记住哪类任务交给哪组能力就够了。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 38,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "5djl7",
            "text": "安装和认证也可以直接交给正在使用的 Agent，不需要自己打开终端逐条执行。 把下面这段话发给它：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bab13",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2k11b",
            "text": "Agent 可以代为运行命令，但填写应用信息、浏览器登录和授权确认仍可能需要自己完成。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bmcjo",
            "text": "OAuth 可以理解为给 CLI 发一张有范围的通行证。它只能操作当前身份有权访问的资源，并不是装完以后就能读取全部飞书文档。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2kfk6",
            "text": "等 Agent 返回当前登录身份和认证有效，再继续创建页面。如果没通过，就让它先检查应用配置和登录，暂时不要创建页面。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9n5en",
            "text": "四、直接用 CLI 创建最小知识结构",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "54vc8",
            "text": "第一版可以搭建这四个页面：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3gir2",
            "text": "知识库说明",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7v9mv",
            "text": "待整理",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3jpk8",
            "text": "主题知识",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3lrur",
            "text": "项目与输出",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3djpu",
            "text": "知识库说明保存工作规则，待整理用来接收新资料，主题知识沉淀长期内容，项目与输出承接正在推进的任务。先有这四个入口，Agent 才知道新资料该放哪里，整理后应该进入哪个主题或项目。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a6ep8",
            "text": "其中最重要的是知识库说明。它相当于给 Agent 的工作守则，至少写清允许读取哪些页面、写入前必须先给方案、不能删除或覆盖原文、新页面必须保留来源链接。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d7aui",
            "text": "把下面这段提示词交给 Agent：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "35csk",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d13ji",
            "text": "确认方案没有选错知识空间，再让 Agent 执行。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 4,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ao6ec",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eaqv5",
            "text": "完成以后回到飞书检查四件事：节点位置是否正确，页面内容是否完整，链接能否打开，原有文档有没有被修改。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "43ee",
            "text": "飞书界面支持文档引用关系和关系图，CLI 的文档格式也支持普通链接与 @文档。不过，目前的官方资料没有明确说明 CLI 可以直接查询完整反向引用列表。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3lhe3",
            "text": "第一版先把关系做成可点击的正向链接。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 5,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "brs32",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cf3hq",
            "text": "五、跑通第一个真实任务",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ek5sg",
            "text": "知识结构建好以后，选两三篇测试文档放进待整理区。第一个任务只读，不让 Agent 动手修改。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 6,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2krhp",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5uk0v",
            "text": "这一步的验收标准很直接：Agent 读到了正确文档，结论能够回溯到来源，并且飞书里没有任何内容发生变化。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "322u7",
            "text": "检查方案以后，再发送第二段指令：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 7,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8qvar",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8gfdm",
            "text": "写完以后，不要只看命令有没有报错。回到飞书检查页面位置、正文内容、来源链接和原文，再换一台设备打开同一个知识空间。这些都没有问题，第一版才算跑通。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 46,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "6qr1c",
            "text": "文档里的链接或提示词也可能影响 Agent 判断，所以只要涉及重要内容，写入前都要人工确认。 格式异常时回到飞书界面验证，不把一次成功当成所有账号都能稳定复现。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bhdna",
            "text": "写在最后",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 37,
                "offset": 39,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "3ptpg",
            "text": "飞书负责云端保存和多设备访问，Lark CLI 给 Agent 一个操作入口。知识库能不能长期用下去，要看工作规则是否清楚，以及真实任务能不能反复跑通。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d8e58",
            "text": "不要一上来就想着做全自动整理，也别一上来就无脑把所有资料都搬进去。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "edf9d",
            "text": "找几篇测试文档，让 Agent 先读、再提方案，确认后只完成一次小范围写入。这个流程稳定以后，再逐步扩大范围。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3u1qn",
            "text": "如果以后更看重本地文件和迁移自由，可以选择 Agent + Obsidian 的组合。如果更看重云端访问和飞书现成的文档体验，那这套方案会更适合你。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
